      "body": "## Overview\n\nAdd RedHatAI GLM checkpoint variants and a DSpark preview option to the existing GLM recipes.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Adds the GLM-5.3 MXFP4 and NVFP4 variants.\n- Adds the GLM-5.3-Flash RedHatAI DSpark preview mode with the card's recommended context and KV-cache settings.\n- Documents the GLM-5.2 MTP repository as supplemental shards, not a standalone selectable model.\n\n## Validation\n\nValidation is pending; this PR is intentionally a draft.\n\n- Passed: `git diff --check`.\n- Planned source validation (not run): from `/home/Roderick-Wu/recipes`, run `pnpm install` if dependencies are missing, then:\n  `node scripts/validate-source.mjs --source vllm --dir /home/Roderick-Wu/recipe-worktrees/glm/recipes`\n- Planned serving smoke test (not run): use the generated H100-compatible GLM command on the 8xH100 node, then check `/v1/models` and send a short `/v1/chat/completions` request.\n- Blackwell-only variants require Blackwell; the DSpark preview requires the separately documented preview software stack.\n\n## Details\n\nExisting GLM runtime and performance PRs do not add these recipe entries. The GLM-5.2 MTP supplement is linked in the YAML with its merge requirement. AI assistance was used to prepare this change.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull Request Checklist</summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill.\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n- [x] Design Fit: confines changes to existing recipe files and preserves defaults.\n- [ ] Testing and Validation: pending author validation.\n- [x] Code Quality and Style: `git diff --check` passed.\n- [x] Pull Request Contents: identifies preview constraints and the supplemental-only checkpoint.\n</details>\n\n",
